Patch-Id: ASTRA-0003
Title: Link astra_blocker_engine into gkrust (libxul)
Tier: P2
Upstream-Files: toolkit/library/rust/shared/Cargo.toml, toolkit/library/rust/shared/lib.rs, Cargo.lock
Intent: link the Astra blocker engine crate into libxul via the gkrust unified crate (F-08 pattern: shared/Cargo.toml dep + extern crate in shared/lib.rs, mirroring content_classifier_engine); no configure option can add a crate to gkrust, so a hook is required
Risk: low (one dep line + one extern crate line, adjacent to the content_classifier_engine precedent; requires `cargo update -p gkrust-shared` at build time)
Test: tools/blocker-wiring-check.sh; full-build proof in follow-up (docs/astra/BLOCKER_WIRING.md section 5)
Verified-On: 153.6.0
Removal-Plan: drop both lines if the blocker moves out of tree (fallback proxy); keep if ESR rebase preserves the gkrust layout
---
